$ enola baseline pin --help
exit: 2
--- stdout
--- stderr
Usage: enola baseline <pin|show|clear> [config_path]

  pin    freeze the current .enola snapshot as the diff baseline
  show   report whether a baseline exists, and what it describes
  clear  remove the pinned baseline

Examples:
  # Freeze the architecture before you start editing
  enola baseline pin

  # The same for another repository
  enola baseline pin /path/to/repo

  # What the pinned baseline describes
  enola baseline show

  # Remove it
  enola baseline clear

See also: enola help check, enola help doctor
